          "reason": "CSV timestamps include a trailing newline, causing strcpy to write18bytes into a17byte buffer and Android FORTIFY to abort at launch. Copy only the16date characters, initialize missingrecords, and bound reads to the allocated top ten.",
          "verification": "Actual original source fortify fixture traps on original timestampline; repaired fixture verifies10dates/points plus64unchanged guardbytes after12inputrecords. Android failure-logcat identifies load_scores+260; native retry pending."
        },
        {
          "file": "proj/src/logic/alien.c",
          "originalSha256": "3a5873e662582ba8ab7dde71f2bd85c48fd31189eb54701b5202716a4b30db25",
          "patchedSha256": "c60e295c2191cb742da9164a49e005a71b2bb3b428d550ea0b55205a91a64da9",
          "reason": "init_alien leaves its shots pointer uninitialized and first alien firing frees arbitrary stack data. Both alien shot removal and player shot removal free an interior array element, invalidating live storage or passing a non-allocation address to free. Initialize shots to NULL, retain the compacted array until empty, then free its base. Return immediately when there are no live aliens to shoot.",
          "verification": "Actual original source regression fails on uninitialized shots; initialization-only variant fails the allocation-base free invariant. Repaired original source passes100 cycles of four shots per side, first/middle/last deletion, preserved coordinates, empty-array cleanup and zero leaked allocations. All9 A source regressions green. Android retry pending."
        },
        {
          "file": "proj/src/logic/player.c",
